{"4247040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Valenium", "steam_appid": 4247040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valenium is a third-person fantasy RPG featuring high-octane action and adventure. Beyond its main narrative, the game offers meticulously written item lore and a vast universe where exploring hidden regions is just the beginning. Fight against The Evolved, ancient mages, and dark enemies in this 3D world with real-time combat mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Distinct Playable Classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from 3 different playable classes—Warrior, Archer, and Mage—each with completely distinct skill sets. It is possible to switch between classes as you progress through the game. Additionally, the game features preference-based passive skill attributes. Valenium is ready for you with 5 different difficulty settings that you can change at any time!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247040/extras/cd718f61d4fc382a765daa57724a866d.poster.avif?t=1777561828\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247040/extras/cd718f61d4fc382a765daa57724a866d.webm?t=1777561828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Items with rich stories. Beyond weapons like bows, swords, and staffs, this collection includes necklaces, earrings, and rings, each woven with unique lore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 Different Specializations (Builds)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Specialize your character exactly how you want! Focus your development on 5 unique areas: Mystic Magic, Dexterity, Critical Hit Chance, Elemental Damage, and a unique trait specific to each class. You can also further empower your spells with potions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247040/extras/175b3c6c99cf296e78c73300092a00ae.poster.avif?t=1777561828\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247040/extras/175b3c6c99cf296e78c73300092a00ae.webm?t=1777561828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Fantastic Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Vibrant and refreshing high-poly forests. Dark dungeons, vast canyons, and castles and villages with a Medieval theme. Valenium mines and dark enemies. The Evolved and dark sorcerers. A wealth of information about the world's past. Discover a new universe with a deep history involving many lineages, including Humans, Sisums, and Gengams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Next-Gen Technologies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fully dynamic Ray Tracing lighting. Cutting-edge Unreal Engine 5 features like Nanite and MegaLights used where needed. Includes many gamer-friendly features such as Nvidia DLSS 4, Nvidia Reflex, AMD FSR Redstone, and AMD Anti-Lag 2<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247040/extras/2df4fa42e48ab1652d6aa22cb81981fd.poster.avif?t=1777561828\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247040/extras/2df4fa42e48ab1652d6aa22cb81981fd.webm?t=1777561828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the Saga</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Valenium combines action and open-world dynamics with skill-based gameplay for fantasy RPG enthusiasts. An immersive experience ranging from strategic character development to visceral combat awaits you. You can change your starting class as you progress through the story if you wish. Explore hidden areas in a universe enriched by item lore, and try to survive against ruthless enemies using staffs, arrows, and swords. The real-time combat mechanics are designed for players seeking both a visual feast and a challenging single-player action experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient secrets of Humans, Sisums, and Gengams are waiting to be discovered by you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valenium is a third-person fantasy RPG featuring high-octane action and adventure. Beyond its main narrative, the game offers meticulously written item lore and a vast universe where exploring hidden regions is just the beginning. Fight against The Evolved, ancient mages, and dark enemies in this 3D world with real-time combat mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Distinct Playable Classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from 3 different playable classes—Warrior, Archer, and Mage—each with completely distinct skill sets. It is possible to switch between classes as you progress through the game. Additionally, the game features preference-based passive skill attributes. Valenium is ready for you with 5 different difficulty settings that you can change at any time!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247040/extras/cd718f61d4fc382a765daa57724a866d.poster.avif?t=1777561828\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247040/extras/cd718f61d4fc382a765daa57724a866d.webm?t=1777561828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Lore</