apps/4247040/extras/2df4fa42e48ab1652d6aa22cb81981fd.poster.avif?t=1777561828\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247040/extras/2df4fa42e48ab1652d6aa22cb81981fd.webm?t=1777561828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the Saga</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Valenium combines action and open-world dynamics with skill-based gameplay for fantasy RPG enthusiasts. An immersive experience ranging from strategic character development to visceral combat awaits you. You can change your starting class as you progress through the story if you wish. Explore hidden areas in a universe enriched by item lore, and try to survive against ruthless enemies using staffs, arrows, and swords. The real-time combat mechanics are designed for players seeking both a visual feast and a challenging single-player action experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient secrets of Humans, Sisums, and Gengams are waiting to be discovered by you.</p>", "short_description": "Brutal combat, a deep skill system, and a magical universe. Let your sword, staff, or bow speak in this fantasy world. Hunt the aggressive 'The Evolved', mutated by Valenium. A deep story and ancient secrets await you.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Turkish, Arabic, Indonesian, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Russian, Thai, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Czech, Portuguese - Brazil, Romanian, Bulgarian, Danish, Finnish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Greek, Swedish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247040/7e24d1387dc2967b73d3c5625ada0f3e14138c2a/header.jpg?t=1777561828", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247040/3822c1a24c2797b01f7fa50d16bb4ff08ba6e